---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../content/site';
const contact = CONTACT_EMAIL || '[contact email to be added before launch]';
---

<Legal
  title={`Website terms | ${site.name}`}
  description={`The terms for using the ${site.name} website, a service by ${site.company}.`}
  heading="Website terms"
>
  <p>
    This website is run by {site.company} ("we", "us"), based in British Columbia, Canada. By using this website, you agree
    to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the website.
  </p>

  <h2>About this website</h2>
  <p>
    This website describes {site.name}, a monthly service we offer. The information here is general. It is not professional
    advice for your specific business.
  </p>

  <h2>These terms are not your service agreement</h2>
  <p>
    These terms cover the use of this website only. If you become a client, the service itself is covered by a separate
    written agreement between you and us. If that agreement and this website ever disagree, the agreement applies.
  </p>

  <h2>Prices</h2>
  <p>
    Prices shown on this website are in Canadian or US dollars as marked, do not include applicable taxes, and can change.
    The price that applies to you is the one confirmed in your service agreement.
  </p>
  <p>
    Our 6- and 12-month plans are billed monthly. If you end one early, you pay the difference between the month-to-month
    price and your plan's price for the months you received. A setup fee that was waived stays waived. Your service agreement sets out the exact terms.
  </p>

  <h2>No promise of results</h2>
  <p>
    We do not promise search rankings, a number of new clients, or that any search or AI tool will show or recommend your
    business. Sample reports and calculators on this website are illustrations only. The calculator gives a rough estimate
    based on the numbers you enter.
  </p>

  <h2>Our content</h2>
  <p>
    The text, design and graphics on this website belong to {site.company} unless marked otherwise. You are welcome to view
    and share links to the website. Please do not copy or republish our content without asking first.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>
    This website links to other websites, such as our booking tool and our newsletter. We do not control those websites and
    are not responsible for their content or how they handle your information.
  </p>

  <h2>Names of other companies</h2>
  <p>
    Names such as Google, ChatGPT, Apple Maps, Bing, Yelp and Facebook belong to their owners. We are not affiliated with,
    endorsed by or sponsored by them.
  </p>

  <h2>Availability and liability</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep this website accurate and available, but we provide it as is, without warranties of any kind. To the
    extent the law allows, we are not liable for any loss that comes from using or relying on this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by the laws of British Columbia and the federal laws of Canada that apply there.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. The current version is always on this page, with the date at the top.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms? Contact us:
    {CONTACT_EMAIL ? <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> : <strong>{contact}</strong>}.
  </p>
</Legal>
